          "web_search_used": false,
          "addressed_to": "",
          "output_tokens": 291,
          "input_tokens": 176437,
          "text": "**High effort has no effect because Claude Test uses CHA\u2019s native Anthropic API connection.**\n\nI checked its saved settings:\n- **Claude Test:** Reasoning effort is **high**.\n- **Provider:** **anthropic-direct**, using the Anthropic API and model **claude-sonnet-4-5**.\n\nIn CHA\u2019s native Anthropic integration, Claude uses **model-default thinking**. CHA\u2019s Reasoning effort control is ignored for this API\u2014including character settings and the chat toolbar. The provider\u2019s saved \u201cnone\u201d value isn\u2019t overriding \u201chigh\u201d; neither setting controls thinking on this connection.\n\nSo this is an integration limitation, not a misconfigured effort setting. Changing effort again won\u2019t fix it. I haven\u2019t changed any configuration.",
